# Allowlist (team decision 2026-10-28): the repository holds only the analysis matrices, the scripts,
# the model results with their run logs, the tables, the figures and the supplementary material.
*
!*/
!/README.md
!/.gitignore
# scripts of every phase and the computing environment
!*.py
!*.R
!*.sh
!/10_phase8_analysis/env/*.yml
# analysis matrices: extraction matrix, tidy tables, analysis datasets, risk-of-bias assessment
!/08_phase6_data_extraction/data_extraction_tropicalis.xlsx
